  &lt;/p&gt;
  &lt;p&gt;
   It contains words.
  &lt;/p&gt;
 &lt;/body&gt;
&lt;/html&gt;

Output:
Generally we want the text nested within certain tags. For instance:

for t in soup.body:
    if t.name == "h1":
        print("header", t.string)
    elif t.name == "p":
        print("paragraph:", t.string)

